    "created_at": "2017-05-08T16:47:20Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-05-08T16:47:20Z",
    "body": "> If you grab a reference to this associated thing and then navigate the initial about:blank frame cross-origin, what happens?\r\n\r\nThe same thing that happens when you navigate any other page cross-origin.  You get a new global object, with a different origin from the old global object.  The things you were holding on to are still referencing the old global object.  Do you have a specific scenario or API you're concerned about?",
